@c This file was generated by "gmsh -doc": do not edit manually!

@table @kbd
@item 0
Read the script again
@item 1 or F1
Mesh the curves
@item 2 or F2
Mesh the surfaces (and the curves they are bounded by)
@item 3 or F3
Mesh the volumes (and what they are bounded by)
@item e
End the selection under way (accept what is picked)
@item g
Go to geometry module
@item m
Go to mesh module
@item p
Go to post-processing module
@item q
Stop the selection under way, as Escape
@item s
Go to solver module
@item u
Undo the last pick of the selection under way
@item w
Merge the files matching the watch pattern
@item x
Toggle x coordinate freeze in geometry creation mode
@item y
Toggle y coordinate freeze in geometry creation mode
@item z
Toggle z coordinate freeze in geometry creation mode
@item Escape (with any modifier)
Stop the selection under way (query, measurement, operation on the entities picked...), cancel a lasso, or leave full screen
@item Left arrow
Go to previous time step
@item Right arrow
Go to next time step
@item Up arrow
Make previous view visible
@item Down arrow
Make next view visible
@item Shift+a
Bring all windows to front
@item Shift+g
Show the geometry options
@item Shift+m
Show the mesh options
@item Shift+o
Show the general options
@item Shift+p
Show post-processing options
@item Shift+s
Show solver options
@item Shift+u
Show post-processing view plugins
@item Shift+w
Show post-processing view options
@item Shift+x
Move only along x coordinate in geometry creation mode
@item Shift+y
Move only along y coordinate in geometry creation mode
@item Shift+z
Move only along z coordinate in geometry creation mode
@item Shift+Escape
Toggle mouse selection on/off (a selection under way goes on)
@item Ctrl+0 or 9
Reload full project
@item Ctrl+d
Dock/undock current tool window
@item Ctrl+e
Export project
@item Ctrl+f
Enter full screen
@item Ctrl+h
Show keyboard and mouse usage
@item Ctrl+i
Show statistics window
@item Ctrl+j
Save model options
@item Ctrl+l
Show message console
@item Ctrl+m
Minimize window
@item Ctrl+n
Create new project file
@item Ctrl+o
Open project file
@item Ctrl+q
Quit
@item Ctrl+r
Rename project file
@item Ctrl+s
Save mesh in default format
@item Ctrl+t
Run solver
@item Shift+Ctrl+c
Show clipping plane window
@item Shift+Ctrl+d
Dock/undock all tool windows
@item Shift+Ctrl+h
Show current options and workspace window
@item Shift+Ctrl+j
Save options as default
@item Shift+Ctrl+m
Show manipulator window
@item Shift+Ctrl+n
Show option window
@item Shift+Ctrl+o
Merge file(s)
@item Shift+Ctrl+r
Open next-to-last opened file
@item Shift+Ctrl+u
Show plugin window
@item Shift+Ctrl+v
Show visibility window
@item Alt+1 or Alt+Shift+1 or Alt+Ctrl+1
Fit the model in the window, reset the bounding box around the visible entities (Shift), or sync the scale between viewports (Ctrl)
@item Alt+3 or Alt+Shift+3
Set isometric 3D view, or from the opposite side (Shift)
@item Alt+a
Loop through axes modes
@item Alt+b
Hide/show bounding boxes
@item Alt+c
Loop through predefined color schemes
@item Alt+d
Loop through geometry surface display modes
@item Alt+e or Alt+Shift+e
Hide/show element outlines for visible post-pro views
@item Alt+f
Change redraw mode (fast/full)
@item Alt+h
Hide/show all post-processing views
@item Alt+i
Hide/show all post-processing view scales
@item Alt+l
Hide/show geometry curves
@item Alt+m
Toggle visibility of all mesh entities
@item Alt+n
Hide/show all post-processing view annotations
@item Alt+o
Change projection mode (orthographic/perspective)
@item Alt+p
Hide/show geometry points
@item Alt+r
Loop through range modes for visible post-pro views
@item Alt+s
